From: ZKTeco <lifaet@zkteco.local>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 08:02:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: flag Undefined variable officeEnd (dashboard+daily
 split)

- Re-add $officeEnd = Setting::getValue('office_end','17:00') for summary office_end (was removed when flag changed to first-punch +-5 only). Keeps flag single-status on first punch with +-5 grace, summary late counts late only.
---
 dashboard/app/Http/Controllers/AttendanceController.php | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/dashboard/app/Http/Controllers/AttendanceController.php b/dashboard/app/Http/Controllers/AttendanceController.php
index 1828aa8..a3d04e5 100644
--- a/dashboard/app/Http/Controllers/AttendanceController.php
+++ b/dashboard/app/Http/Controllers/AttendanceController.php
@@ -140,6 +140,7 @@ public function data(Request $request)
 
             // --- Flag: single status from first_punch with +-5 min grace around office_start ---
             $officeStart = Setting::getValue('office_start', '09:30');
+            $officeEnd = Setting::getValue('office_end', '17:00');
             $grace = 5; // minutes
             [$oh, $om] = array_map('intval', explode(':', $officeStart));
             $officeMin = $oh * 60 + $om;
